    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "being gentle with myself doesnt really change anything though. it just feels like i'm delaying the inevitable. the struggle is so draining and it feels like there's no point to any of it. like no matter how hard i try, i'm just going to end up right back here in the dirt. what's even the point of trying to fix something that's just fundamentally broken?",
